   "claims": [
    "Hours Calculator Enter hhmm without the colon : 915, 1225, etc.",
    "If you enter a single number from 1 through 12 the hours calculator assumes 1:00 through 12:00, on the hour, with no minutes.",
    "Converting Between Clock Time and Decimal Hours Suppose you calculated a total time of 7:15, 7 hours and 15 minutes.",
    "The equivalent time in decimal hours is 7.25 hours.",
    "Converting from minutes to decimal hours 40:24 is 40.0 hours plus 24 minutes.",
    "First convert the minutes part to hours: divide minutes by 60.",
    "24 minutes divided by 60 minutes makes the conversion from minutes to decimal hours.",
    "24 min ÷ 60 = 0.4 hours Adding 0.4 decimal hours to 40.0 hours, the total is 40.0 + 0.4 = 40.4 hours In Reverse, converting from decimal hours to minutes To get 0.4 hours as minutes, multiply decimal hours by 60."
   ],
